; Message's privileged Signal.
;
; The owner Sends here, stamped Owner. Redeliver is the only way out of
; Uncertain: it hands Flow a new delivery of the same message to the same
; recipient.
;
; Meta Configure marks the stored configuration as Meta-configured. A
; changed address takes effect when the Nexus restarts, so the reply is
; RestartRequired.

Signal
[ signal_flow:[ FlowId ] meta_signal_flow:[ MetaRefusal ] signal_message:[ MessageId SendRequest Submission SendRejection Receipt MessageRejection ] message_library:[ Configuration ] ]
[ Configure.Configuration Send.SendRequest Redeliver.RedeliverRequest ]
[ Configured RestartRequired Refused.ConfigureRefusal Submitted.Submission SendRejected.SendRejection Redelivered.Receipt RedeliverRejected.MessageRejection MetaRefused.MetaRefusal ]
[ ConfigureRefusal.[ StoreRefused ]
  RedeliverRequest.{ MessageId FlowId } ]
